sequenceDiagram
    participant P as pedidos
    participant AS as Keycloak
    participant I as inventario
    P->>AS: POST /token grant_type=client_credentials<br/>client_id + client_secret
    AS->>P: access_token (exp: 5 min)
    Note right of P: lo guarda mientras es válido
    P->>I: GET /api/stock/teclado (Bearer token)
    I->>P: 200 OK
    P->>I: GET /api/stock/raton (mismo token)
    I->>P: 200 OK
    Note right of P: al caducar, pide otro
